  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Inclusive Livelihoods for Poor Rural Communities in Eastern Indonesia Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased access to livelihoods opportunities for populations vulnerable to poverty and food insecurity in eighty (80) target villages in Maluku and East Nusa Tenggara provinces in Eastern Indonesia.The target beneficiary is approximately 9,900 (50% female) vulnerable community members in approximately 80 villages in Maluku and East Nusa Tenggara provinces in Eastern Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
